#: crates/opencrt/ui/main.slint:2197
msgid ""
"Session output is appended as plain text while connected. %S expands to the "
"session name, %H to the hostname, %Y %M %D to the date and %h %m %s to the "
"time (of connecting, in the file name; of writing, in the texts above). A "
"log named with the date starts a new file at midnight."
msgstr "Cuirtear aschur an tseisiúin leis mar ghnáth-théacs fad atá sé ceangailte. Leathnaíonn %S go hainm an tseisiúin, %H go dtí an t-óstainm, %Y %M %D go dtí an dáta agus %h %m %s go dtí an t-am (am an cheangail, in ainm an chomhaid; am na scríbhneoireachta, sna téacsanna thuas). Tosaíonn loga a bhfuil an dáta ina ainm comhad nua ag meán oíche."

#: crates/opencrt/ui/main.slint:2206
msgid ""
"A VNC desktop is the size the server sets: shown whole, scaled down when the "
"tab is smaller, or with Scale to window stretched to fill the tab. "
"Connection speed sets the picture quality; the other settings here are for "
"RDP sessions. VNC is not encrypted: set a jump host (Connection page) to "
"tunnel it through SSH."
msgstr "Is é an freastalaí a shocraíonn méid na deisce VNC: taispeántar ina hiomláine í, laghdaithe nuair is lú an cluaisín, nó sínte chun an cluaisín a líonadh le Scálaigh go dtí an fhuinneog. Socraíonn luas an cheangail cáilíocht an phictiúir; is do sheisiúin RDP na socruithe eile anseo. Níl VNC criptithe: socraigh óstríomhaire léime (leathanach Ceangal) chun é a thollánú trí SSH."

#: crates/opencrt/ui/main.slint:2211
msgid "These settings are for RDP sessions."
msgstr "Is do sheisiúin RDP na socruithe seo."

#: crates/opencrt/ui/main.slint:2216
msgid "Desktop size:"
msgstr "Méid na deisce:"

#: crates/opencrt/ui/main.slint:2220
msgid "width"
msgstr "leithead"

#: crates/opencrt/ui/main.slint:2224
msgid "x"
msgstr "x"

#: crates/opencrt/ui/main.slint:2230
msgid "height"
msgstr "airde"

#: crates/opencrt/ui/main.slint:2235
msgid "Scale to window"
msgstr "Scálaigh go dtí an fhuinneog"

#: crates/opencrt/ui/main.slint:2240
msgid ""
"Blank: the remote desktop follows the tab's size. A fixed size (in pixels) "
"stays the same whatever the window does: shown whole, scaled down when the "
"tab is smaller, or with Scale to window stretched to fill the tab."
msgstr "Bán: leanann an deasc chianda méid an chluaisín. Fanann méid seasta (i bpicteilíní) mar an gcéanna is cuma cad a dhéanann an fhuinneog: taispeántar ina hiomláine í, laghdaithe nuair is lú an cluaisín, nó sínte chun an cluaisín a líonadh le Scálaigh go dtí an fhuinneog."

#: crates/opencrt/ui/main.slint:2247
msgid "Connection speed:"
msgstr "Luas an cheangail:"

#: crates/opencrt/ui/main.slint:2250
msgid "Best quality: lossless (fast network)"
msgstr "An cháilíocht is fearr: gan chaillteanas (líonra tapa)"

#: crates/opencrt/ui/main.slint:2250
msgid "Balanced: photos and video as JPEG"
msgstr "Cothromaithe: grianghraif agus físeán mar JPEG"

#: crates/opencrt/ui/main.slint:2250
msgid "Fastest: lower JPEG quality (slow links)"
msgstr "Is tapúla: cáilíocht JPEG níos ísle (naisc mhalla)"

#: crates/opencrt/ui/main.slint:2251
msgid "Best appearance (fast network)"
msgstr "An chuma is fearr (líonra tapa)"

#: crates/opencrt/ui/main.slint:2251
msgid "Balanced: no wallpaper or animations"
msgstr "Cothromaithe: gan cúlbhrat ná beochan"

#: crates/opencrt/ui/main.slint:2251
msgid "Fastest: no visual effects (slow links)"
msgstr "Is tapúla: gan maisíochtaí amhairc (naisc mhalla)"

#: crates/opencrt/ui/main.slint:2258
msgid ""
"VNC servers with the Tight encoding (TightVNC, TigerVNC, x11vnc) send "
"pictures and video as JPEG when this is Balanced or Fastest; text and flat "
"areas stay exact. Others always send the exact picture."
msgstr "Seolann freastalaithe VNC a bhfuil an t-ionchódú Tight acu (TightVNC, TigerVNC, x11vnc) pictiúir agus físeán mar JPEG nuair atá sé seo ar Cothromaithe nó Is tapúla; fanann téacs agus limistéir aonathacha beacht. Seolann freastalaithe eile an pictiúr beacht i gcónaí."

#: crates/opencrt/ui/main.slint:2259
msgid ""
"The less the server draws, the less it sends: leaving out the wallpaper and "
"animations makes the desktop noticeably quicker over the internet or a VPN."
msgstr "Dá lú a tharraingíonn an freastalaí, is lú a sheolann sé: má fhágtar an cúlbhrat agus beochan ar lár, bíonn an deasc i bhfad níos sciobtha thar an idirlíon nó VPN."

#: crates/opencrt/ui/main.slint:2265
msgid ""
"Use H.264 when the server offers it (much faster; turn off if the desktop "
"stays black)"
msgstr "Úsáid H.264 nuair a thairgeann an freastalaí é (i bhfad níos tapúla; múch é má fhanann an deasc dubh)"

#: crates/opencrt/ui/main.slint:2270
msgid "Connect to the console (administrative) session, like mstsc /admin"
msgstr "Ceangail leis an seisiún consóil (riaracháin), cosúil le mstsc /admin"

#: crates/opencrt/ui/main.slint:2275
msgid "Play the remote computer's sound on this computer"
msgstr "Seinn fuaim an ríomhaire chianda ar an ríomhaire seo"

#: crates/opencrt/ui/main.slint:2280
msgid "Share a local folder:"
msgstr "Comhroinn fillteán logánta:"

#: crates/opencrt/ui/main.slint:2284
msgid "none"
msgstr "dada"

#: crates/opencrt/ui/main.slint:2293
msgid ""
"The folder appears on the remote computer as a drive (under This PC), named "
"after the folder: copy files to and from it there. The remote computer can "
"read, change and delete everything in it."
msgstr "Feictear an fillteán ar an ríomhaire cianda mar thiomántán (faoi This PC), ainmnithe as an bhfillteán: cóipeáil comhaid chuige agus uaidh ansin. Is féidir leis an ríomhaire cianda gach rud ann a léamh, a athrú agus a scriosadh."

#: crates/opencrt/ui/main.slint:2302
msgid ""
"Keys mapped for this session (tried before Global Options > Keyboard), one "
"per line:"
msgstr "Eochracha mapáilte don seisiún seo (triailtear iad roimh Roghanna Domhanda > Méarchlár), ceann in aghaidh an líne:"

#: crates/opencrt/ui/main.slint:2311
msgid ""
"Key = what it does. Keys: F1-F24, Up, Home, PageUp, Insert, Delete, Tab, "
"Enter, Escape, Space or a character, with Ctrl+ Alt+ Shift+ (characters need "
"Ctrl or Alt). Text is sent (\\r is Enter); or script: file, menu: command, "
"run: program, telnet: brk|ayt|ip|ao|ec|el|ga|nop."
msgstr "Eochair = an rud a dhéanann sí. Eochracha: F1-F24, Up, Home, PageUp, Insert, Delete, Tab, Enter, Escape, Space nó carachtar, le Ctrl+ Alt+ Shift+ (teastaíonn Ctrl nó Alt ó charachtair). Seoltar téacs (is é \\r Enter); nó script: comhad, menu: ordú, run: ríomhchlár, telnet: brk|ayt|ip|ao|ec|el|ga|nop."

#: crates/opencrt/ui/main.slint:2320 crates/opencrt/ui/main.slint:7369
msgid "Script file:"
msgstr "Comhad scripte:"

#: crates/opencrt/ui/main.slint:2323 crates/opencrt/ui/main.slint:2716
msgid "blank for none"
msgstr "bán le haghaidh dada"

#: crates/opencrt/ui/main.slint:2331
msgid "Or write the script here (used when no file is set):"
msgstr "Nó scríobh an script anseo (úsáidtear é nuair nach bhfuil comhad socraithe):"

#: crates/opencrt/ui/main.slint:2339
msgid ""
"Runs each time the session connects. A .rhai file runs as a Rhai script and "
"a .py file as a SecureCRT Python script (see the README). Otherwise one "
"command per line: wait <text> (for the host to print it), send <text> (\\r "
"is Enter), sleep <ms>, timeout <s> (for later waits; default 30), # comment."
msgstr "Ritheann sé gach uair a cheanglaíonn an seisiún. Ritheann comhad .rhai mar script Rhai agus comhad .py mar script Python SecureCRT (féach an README). Seachas sin, ordú amháin in aghaidh an líne: wait <text> (go bpriontálann an t-óstríomhaire é), send <text> (is é \\r Enter), sleep <ms>, timeout <s> (do na fanachtaí ina dhiaidh; réamhshocrú 30), # nóta tráchta."

#: crates/opencrt/ui/main.slint:2348
msgid "Forward X11 to the local X server"
msgstr "Atreoraigh X11 chuig an bhfreastalaí X logánta"

#: crates/opencrt/ui/main.slint:2353
msgid ""
"Uses $DISPLAY, else display 0 on this machine. The X server must accept "
"clients without its own cookie (e.g. VcXsrv with access control disabled)."
msgstr "Úsáideann sé $DISPLAY, nó taispeáint 0 ar an meaisín seo murach sin. Caithfidh an freastalaí X glacadh le cliaint gan a fhianán féin (m.sh. VcXsrv le rialú rochtana díchumasaithe)."

