"Passphrase (SecureCRT asks for it when it starts) to import them. If "
"SecureCRT has none, set one with Change Passphrase... in its start-up "
"window, then import again."
msgstr "Tá focail faire sábháilte ag {} seisiún iompórtáilte. Cuir isteach Config Passphrase SecureCRT (iarrann SecureCRT é nuair a thosaíonn sé) chun iad a iompórtáil. Mura bhfuil ceann ag SecureCRT, socraigh ceann le Change Passphrase... ina fhuinneog tosaithe, ansin iompórtáil arís."

#: crates/opencrt/ui/main.slint:3950
msgid ""
"Keep saved passwords and key passphrases in the settings folder, encrypted "
"with a master password, instead of this computer's keychain. Settings Sync "
"carries them, still encrypted. A forgotten master password cannot be "
"recovered: the saved passwords would have to be entered again."
msgstr "Coinnigh focail faire agus frásaí faire eochracha sábháilte san fhillteán socruithe, criptithe le máistirfhocal faire, in ionad fháinne eochracha an ríomhaire seo. Iompraíonn Sioncrónú Socruithe iad, criptithe fós. Ní féidir máistirfhocal faire dearmadta a aisghabháil: bheadh ort na focail faire sábháilte a chur isteach arís."

#: crates/opencrt/ui/main.slint:3951
